In measure 8, none of the tracks have .detune() or .glide() (brass: [f3 c4 a4]:2 [g3 d4 b4]:2, horns: a4:2 b4:2, str_lo: f2:2 g2:2)—only saws in measure 9 has .detune(85%, 0.3..0.9).
