Why Beats Were Missing / Disappearing Near the Playhead (M8 & M9):
isPlayheadOverStartPill hid any note pill within 36px of playheadX. At 20% zoom (56px per full 4-beat measure), 36px is 65% of an entire measure, which caused the pills for Beat 3 ([g3 d4 b4]:2, b4:2, g2:2) in Measure 8 and Beat 1 in Measure 9 to disappear completely whenever the playhead approached them.
Why Pills Overlapped in Dense Measures (M15) & Fullscreen Button Was Missing:
At 20% zoom, 8th/quarter notes are 7px–14px wide while the pill box was hardcoded to 18px–40px wide, causing consecutive beats in M15 to stack on top of each other ([5][5][5][5]), and the Fullscreen / Mobile layout updates from TDB-736 had not yet been applied to Transport.tsx and SplitWorkspace.tsx.
